!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
! 4) decompostion by o, oh
! and ho2 attack
! c10h21+o=alkyl+aldehyde
! c10h21+oh=alkane+aldehyde
! c10h21+ho2=>alkyl+aldehyde+oh
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!


!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
! 5) isomerisation
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

Ac6h13=Bc6h13                  1.820E+02    2.55   10961.0 ! Tsang et al. 2007 31st Symp. Int. Comb. pp. 141-148
                         rev / 1.700E+01    2.89   13380.0/
