                         rev / 7.080E+00    3.23   18938.0/


!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
! 6) O2 addition
! c6h13+o2=c6h13o2
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

Ac6h13+o2=c6h13qjA                     9.000E+18    -2.50       0.0 ! Buda et al., Combust Flame, 142 (2005) 170-186 (ks)
